      "html": "<div class=\"ds-cal\"><button class=\"ds-day ds-off\" disabled><span>5</span></button><button class=\"ds-day ds-no\"><span>6</span><b>нет</b></button><button class=\"ds-day ds-ok\"><span>7</span><b>9</b><small>от 10 800 ₽</small></button><button class=\"ds-day ds-low\"><span>10</span><b>2</b><small>от 10 800 ₽</small></button><button class=\"ds-day ds-ok\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span>12</span><b>23</b><small>от 10 800 ₽</small></button></div>",
